### Customer risk scoring - exploratory requests (IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client)
### There is no identity source yet: until one is configured every call answers 401 (BR-01, fail-closed).
### The end-to-end tests inject the caller; this file shows the shapes and the expected refusals.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Evaluate (ONBOARDING_SYSTEM) -> 200 {customerNumber, version}; 401 while nobody is identified
POST {{host}}/api/risk-profiles/C-1001/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileClass": "POLITICALLY_EXPOSED",
  "residence": {"country": "DE", "riskClass": "LOW"},
  "citizenships": [{"country": "DE", "riskClass": "LOW"}],
  "birth": {"country": "DE", "riskClass": "LOW"},
  "loginCountry": "AE",
  "channel": "REMOTE",
  "highRiskProductRequest": true,
  "adverseMediaClass": "UNCONFIRMED_FINANCIAL_CRIME",
  "sanctionsMatch": false,
  "terroristLink": false,
  "forgedIdentity": false
}

### 2. Compliance view (L1, L2, MLRO) -> 200 with score, tracks, explanation, version
GET {{host}}/api/risk-profiles/C-1001

### 3. Front-office status (any identified caller) -> 200 {customerNumber, status, message}; no risk data
GET {{host}}/api/risk-profiles/C-1001/front-office-status

### 4. Freeze (L2, MLRO) -> 200 {customerNumber, version}; 409 when versionViewed is stale
POST {{host}}/api/risk-profiles/C-1001/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "FREEZE_ASSETS",
  "justification": "Analyst reviewed the alert and the documents",
  "versionViewed": 1
}

### 5. Unknown decision kind -> 400 (403 first for a role that may not decide at all)
POST {{host}}/api/risk-profiles/C-1001/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind": "NOT_A_KIND", "justification": "Analyst reviewed the alert and the documents", "versionViewed": 1}
